  "_eligibility_text": "1. The applicant should be a female.\n1. The applicant should be a resident of Maharashtra state.\n1. The applicant&#39;s age should be between 21-65 years.\n1. The applicant should have their bank account with an Aadhaar link.\n1. The annual income of the applicant&#39;s family should not exceed ₹2,50,000/-. \n1. Outsourced employees, voluntary workers, and contract workers with income up to ₹2,50,000/- are eligible.\n1. The applicant should be any one of the following:\n\n  - Married Woman \n  - Widowed \n  - Divorced Woman\n  - Abandoned and Destitute Women \n  - One Unmarried Woman in the family",
